real-time device battery and temperature levels.\n\n* Use Theater Mode for streamlined viewings where all viewer controls are disabled.  You can customize your screening setup with a short countdown sequence and other options to fit the needs of your VR screening.\n\n* Add your own logo and message through the LensPass Screening Dashboard.\n\n* After your VR screenings, view auto-generated analytics reports that show include the viewing completion rates and other information", "short_description": "Use LensPass to watch and share 360-degree videos, and pair it with the accompanying LensPass Android app for more customization and control features that are designed to help share VR experiences."}]}, "developer_name": "WeLens, Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.welens.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.welens.com/terms", "publisher_name": "WeLens, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.welens.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["UTILITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "pt_BR", "es_MX", "es", "fr_CA", "fr", "ru"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "646708609904846"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75222940_2615054845438439_5862910043015348224_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RNRCIHRPcDsQ7kNvwFFTEfK&_nc_oc=Adq9ddf5Ghd--vtA8AZXFJNFcuMU4mkbVD2nhiD1Wuxou9k_GXIzq06XGkCH24I0-po&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculus